---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="A little about me and what I write about.">
  <div class="page-header">
    <h1>About</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="prose about-content">
    <p>
      Hi, I'm <strong>Your Name</strong>. I'm a software developer with a love for
      clean code, interesting problems, and occasionally writing about them.
    </p>

    <p>
      This blog is where I share what I'm learning, thinking about, and building.
      Topics drift between backend systems, developer tooling, and whatever rabbit
      hole I've fallen into recently.
    </p>

    <h2>What I write about</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Software development</strong> — patterns, architecture, tools</li>
      <li><strong>Web technologies</strong> — mostly the backend, sometimes the frontend</li>
      <li><strong>Productivity</strong> — workflows, systems, and how to think</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Get in touch</h2>
    <p>
      You can find me on <a href="https://github.com" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.
      For anything else, email me at <a href="mailto:hello@example.com">hello@example.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .about-content {
    padding-bottom: 3rem;
  }
</style>
